        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storeroom Function Lever for Global Series TH1100EDTBAR</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Storeroom Function Lever (lever is fixed, entry by key only) for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a> and other manufactures <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWill fit a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole. Removable studs so it works with doors prepared with and with out commercial thru-bolt holes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for Global TH1100-LHST Storeroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Storeroom - Entry by turning key. Key does NOT unlock the lever. Key unlatches the exit device when turned so you can open the door from the outside. </li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Chrome</b> or <b>Dark Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preps</li>\r\n<li>Standard Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
